Preview a saved rule or an unsaved JSON form; returns the token Apply requires

Usage: mxr rules treatment-preview [OPTIONS] [RULE]

Arguments:
  [RULE]

Options:
      --form <FORM>  RuleFormData JSON file, or - for stdin. Does not save the draft
  -h, --help         Print help
